    "## 4. Exploratory Data Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "This section investigates relationships among variables that are relevant to the fraud-risk problem. The objective is to identify patterns, class-specific differences, potential modeling signals, and issues requiring further investigation.\n",
    "\n",
    "The analysis remains descriptive at this stage. Feature engineering, encoding, resampling, and model-specific transformations are deferred to Data Preparation."
   ]
  },
