   "source": [
    "### 4.1 Fraud by Transaction Category\n",
    "\n",
    "Transaction category may be associated with different fraud behavior. The overall fraud rate of approximately 1.211% can conceal substantial variation across categories.\n",
    "\n",
    "For each transaction category, examine:\n",
    "\n",
    "- total transaction volume;\n",
    "- number of fraudulent transactions; and\n",
    "- within-category fraud rate.\n",
    "\n",
    "Both fraud counts and fraud rates are required because a category with a high fraud rate but few transactions has a different operational significance from a high-volume category containing many fraud cases."
   ]
  },
